    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm a solo developer from Germany, and this is my first game.<br>Thanks to the support of <i>Bagpack Games</i>, I was able to create this first demo, which I plan to expand into a full game later on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope you enjoy it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Sanatorium</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285430/extras/3f5fa3b52df6d4705fe1f905bee6b72d.poster.avif?t=1749209062\" width=800 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285430/extras/3f5fa3b52df6d4705fe1f905bee6b72d.webm?t=1749209062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285430/extras/3f5fa3b52df6d4705fe1f905bee6b72d.mp4?t=1749209062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Explore the environment of the Sanatorium and try to stay calm\u00a0despite the Horrors that might be hidden in the shadows around every corner.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Escape</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285430/extras/c8ccbbea0035ab82e5e78e1fe2377fb9.poster.avif?t=1749209062\" width=800 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285430/extras/c8ccbbea0035ab82e5e78e1fe2377fb9.webm?t=1749209062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285430/extras/c8ccbbea0035ab82e5e78e1fe2377fb9.mp4?t=1749209062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your way through the rooms of the Sanatorium, equipped with nothing but the clothes you wear. Pay close attention to your surroundings and you might find some tools that can help you on your journey.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285430/extras/c3656be9e22085c3f2f7ebc7ab33b733.poster.avif?t=1749209062\" width=800 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285430/extras/c3656be9e22085c3f2f7ebc7ab33b733.webm?t=1749209062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285430/extras/c3656be9e22085c3f2f7ebc7ab33b733.mp4?t=1749209062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes the path might not be clear from the start. Pay close attention to your environment and solve thrilling puzzles to delve deeper into the darkest corners of the Sanatorium.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm a solo developer from Germany, and this is my first game.<br>Thanks to the support of <i>Bagpack Games</i>, I was able to create this first demo, which I plan to expand into a full game later on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope you enjoy it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Sanatorium</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285430/extras/3f5fa3b52df6d4705fe1f905bee6b72d.poster.avif?t=1749209062\" width=800 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285430/extras/3f5fa3b52df6d4705fe1f905bee6b72d.webm?t=1749209062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285430/extras/3f5fa3b52df6d4705fe1f905bee6b72d.mp4?t=1749209062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Explore the environment of the Sanatorium and try to stay calm\u00a0despite the Horrors that might be hidden in the shadows around every corner.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Escape</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285430/extras/c8ccbbea0035ab82e5e78e1fe2377fb9.poster.avif?t=1749209062\" width=800 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285430/extras/c8ccbbea0035ab82e5e78e1fe2377fb9.webm?t=1749209062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285430/extras/c8ccbbea0035ab82e5e78e1fe2377fb9.mp4?t=1749209062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your way through the rooms of the Sanatorium, equipped with nothing but the clothes you wear. Pay close attention to your surroundings and you might find some tools that can help you on your journey.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285430/extras/c3656be9e22085c3f2f7ebc7ab33b733.poster.avif?t=1749209062\" width=800 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285430/extras/c3656be9e22085c3f2f7ebc7ab33b733.webm?t=1749209062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285430/extras/c3656be9e22085c3f2f7ebc7ab33b733.mp4?t=1749209062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes the path might not be clear from the start. Pay close attention to your environment and solve thrilling puzzles to delve deeper into the darkest corners of the Sanatorium.</p>",
    "short_description": "The Patient is a classic escape game in ego perspective where you find yourself in a Sanatorium in the 1930s. Explore the mysterious location and solve cunning Puzzles to progress further. But stay alert, you are not alone! Will you be able to find your way out?",
